		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00001 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00001-s " data-id="e00001" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00001">
    <section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00002 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00002-s " data-id="e00002" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00002">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00003 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00003-s " data-id="e00003" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00003">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00004 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00004-s " data-id="e00004" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00004">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">Verbo</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00006-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00006">Live immersion · Spanish · Portuguese · Italian · French · Greek</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    			<h1 data-interaction-id="e00009" class="e-ykrhga-e00009-s e-heading-base">Eight weeks. Four people in the room. No English after minute three.</h1>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000a">Verbo runs live immersion courses of four students, twice a week, ninety minutes each. By week eight you will hold a fifteen-minute conversation with a stranger about something that matters to you.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000b-s " data-id="e0000b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c"><a href="#placement" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Book a placement call
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000d">Twenty minutes, free, nobody buys before it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000f-s " data-id="e0000f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000f">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g">4</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000h">students in the room, every session</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000i-s " data-id="e0000i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000j">22</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000k">minutes an hour you personally speak</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000l-s " data-id="e0000l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000l">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">16</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000n">ninety-minute sessions, £420 total</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000o-s " data-id="e0000o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000o">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000p-s " data-id="e0000p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000q-s " data-id="e0000q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000r-s " data-id="e0000r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000s">The spine · week by week</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0000t" class="e-ykrhga-e0000t-s e-heading-base">What you can do by Friday</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000u">Not a syllabus. A list of things you could not do on Monday and can do by the end of the week, out loud, to a person.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000v-s " data-id="e0000v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000w-s " data-id="e0000w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000x-s " data-id="e0000x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0000y-s " data-id="e0000y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000y">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0000z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000z">1</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00010 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00010-s " data-id="e00010" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00010">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00011 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00011-s " data-id="e00011" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00011">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00012" class="e-ykrhga-e00012-s e-heading-base">Introduce yourself without translating</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00013-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00013">Week 1: you will introduce yourself and ask three follow-up questions without translating in your head. It will be exhausting.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00014 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00014-s " data-id="e00014" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00014">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00015 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00015-s " data-id="e00015" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00015">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00016 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00016-s " data-id="e00016" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00016">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00017-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00017">2</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00018 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00018-s " data-id="e00018" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00018">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00019 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00019-s " data-id="e00019" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00019">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001a" class="e-ykrhga-e0001a-s e-heading-base">Order, ask, misunderstand, ask again</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001b">Week 2: you will order food, ask for directions and misunderstand the answer. Then you will ask a second time, differently, and get it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001c-s " data-id="e0001c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001d-s " data-id="e0001d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001e-s " data-id="e0001e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001f">3</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001g-s " data-id="e0001g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001g">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001h-s " data-id="e0001h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001h">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001i" class="e-ykrhga-e0001i-s e-heading-base">Talk about yesterday, badly</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001j">Week 3: the past tense arrives and it arrives wrong. You will tell the room what you did at the weekend and nobody will stop you mid-sentence.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001k-s " data-id="e0001k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001k">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001l-s " data-id="e0001l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001m-s " data-id="e0001m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001n">4</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001o-s " data-id="e0001o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001o">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001p-s " data-id="e0001p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001p">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001q" class="e-ykrhga-e0001q-s e-heading-base">Argue about something small</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001r">Week 4: you will argue about something small. Food, weather, football. You will be wrong grammatically and understood completely.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001s-s " data-id="e0001s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001t-s " data-id="e0001t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001u-s " data-id="e0001u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001v">5</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001w-s " data-id="e0001w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001w">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0001x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0001x-s " data-id="e0001x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0001x">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0001y" class="e-ykrhga-e0001y-s e-heading-base">Take a phone call with no notes</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0001z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0001z">Week 5: your teacher rings you without warning. Four minutes, no script, no screen to read from. Everyone survives it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00020 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00020-s " data-id="e00020" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00020">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00021 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00021-s " data-id="e00021" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00021">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00022 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00022-s " data-id="e00022" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00022">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00023-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00023">6</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00024 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00024-s " data-id="e00024" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00024">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00025 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00025-s " data-id="e00025" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00025">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00026" class="e-ykrhga-e00026-s e-heading-base">Explain your job to a stranger</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00027-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00027">Week 6: you will explain what you do for a living to someone who does not do it, twice, in two different ways, until the second way is shorter.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00028 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00028-s " data-id="e00028" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00028">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00029 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00029-s " data-id="e00029" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00029">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002a-s " data-id="e0002a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002b">7</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002c-s " data-id="e0002c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002c">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002d-s " data-id="e0002d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002d">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002e" class="e-ykrhga-e0002e-s e-heading-base">Choose your topic and defend it</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002f">Week 7: you choose the subject for week eight and you argue for that choice in the language. Homework is one conversation with someone outside the class.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002g-s " data-id="e0002g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002h-s " data-id="e0002h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002i-s " data-id="e0002i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002j">8</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002k-s " data-id="e0002k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002k">
    
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002l-s " data-id="e0002l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002l">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0002m" class="e-ykrhga-e0002m-s e-heading-base">Fifteen minutes with a stranger</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002n">Week 8: fifteen minutes with a stranger over video, unscripted, on a topic you chose in week seven. We record it and send it to you, and you should keep it.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002o-s " data-id="e0002o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002p"><a href="#placement" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Start at week one
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002q">Intakes begin the first Monday of every month. Cohorts of four fill in about nine days.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002r-s " data-id="e0002r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002r">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002s e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002s-s " data-id="e0002s" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002s">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002t-s " data-id="e0002t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002t">
    			<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0002u-s" data-interaction-id="e0002u" id="288" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-verbo-immersion-class_small-1.jpg" width="1024" height="576" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-verbo-immersion-class_small-1.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-verbo-immersion-class_small-1-300x169.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-verbo-immersion-class_small-1-768x432.jpg 768w" alt="Four students and a teacher around a small table mid-conversation"/>		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002v-s " data-id="e0002v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002v">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002w">The whole method</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0002x" class="e-ykrhga-e0002x-s e-heading-base">Why four students and not twelve</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0002y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0002y">Four students. In a class of twelve you speak for six minutes an hour. In a class of four you speak for twenty-two. That single number is the whole method.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0002z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0002z-s " data-id="e0002z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0002z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00030 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00030-s " data-id="e00030" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00030">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00031-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00031">Class of twelve — 6 min / hour</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00032 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00032-s " data-id="e00032" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00032">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00033 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00033-s " data-id="e00033" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00033">
    
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00034 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00034-s " data-id="e00034" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00034">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00035-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00035">Class of four — 22 min / hour</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00036 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00036-s " data-id="e00036" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00036">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00037 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00037-s " data-id="e00037" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00037">
    
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00038 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00038-s " data-id="e00038" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00038">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00039 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00039-s " data-id="e00039" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00039">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003a-s " data-id="e0003a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003a">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003b">The people in the room with you</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0003c" class="e-ykrhga-e0003c-s e-heading-base">The teachers, and where they are from</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003d">Teachers are native speakers who live in the language, not in a curriculum. They will talk to you about their own street, their own football team and their own arguments with their own mother.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003e-s " data-id="e0003e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003e">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0003f-s" data-interaction-id="e0003f" id="289" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-verbo-immersion-street_life-1.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-verbo-immersion-street_life-1.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-verbo-immersion-street_life-1-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-verbo-immersion-street_life-1-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="A busy street where the language is spoken every day"/>		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003g-s " data-id="e0003g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003h-s " data-id="e0003h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003h">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003i" class="e-ykrhga-e0003i-s e-heading-base">Núria Bosch</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003j">Girona, Catalonia · teaches Spanish</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003k-s " data-id="e0003k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003k">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003l" class="e-ykrhga-e0003l-s e-heading-base">Tiago Almeida</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003m">Porto, Portugal · teaches Portuguese</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003n-s " data-id="e0003n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003n">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003o" class="e-ykrhga-e0003o-s e-heading-base">Giulia Ferrero</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003p">Bologna, Italy · teaches Italian</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003q-s " data-id="e0003q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003q">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003r" class="e-ykrhga-e0003r-s e-heading-base">Malik Ferhat</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003s">Marseille, France · teaches French</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003t-s " data-id="e0003t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003t">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0003u" class="e-ykrhga-e0003u-s e-heading-base">Eleni Ráptis</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003v">Thessaloniki, Greece · teaches Greek</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0003w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0003w">Every teacher has been through our own placement call from the other side of the screen. None of them will let you switch to English at minute four.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003x-s " data-id="e0003x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003x">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003y-s " data-id="e0003y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003y">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0003z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0003z-s " data-id="e0003z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0003z">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00040 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00040-s " data-id="e00040" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00040">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00041-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00041">Five languages</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00042" class="e-ykrhga-e00042-s e-heading-base">Languages and levels offered</h2>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00043-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00043">Spanish, Portuguese, Italian, French and Greek, from complete beginner to B2. Your level is set on the call, not by a form.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00044 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00044-s " data-id="e00044" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00044">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00045 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00045-s " data-id="e00045" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00045">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00046" class="e-ykrhga-e00046-s e-heading-base">Spanish</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00047-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00047">Español</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00048-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00048">Complete beginner → B2. Four cohorts a month.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00049 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00049-s " data-id="e00049" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00049">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004a" class="e-ykrhga-e0004a-s e-heading-base">Portuguese</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004b">Português</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004c">Complete beginner → B2. European and Brazilian.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004d-s " data-id="e0004d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004d">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004e" class="e-ykrhga-e0004e-s e-heading-base">Italian</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004f">Italiano</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004g">Complete beginner → B2. Two cohorts a month.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004h-s " data-id="e0004h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004h">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004i" class="e-ykrhga-e0004i-s e-heading-base">French</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004j">Français</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004k">Complete beginner → B2. Four cohorts a month.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004m" class="e-ykrhga-e0004m-s e-heading-base">Greek</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004n">Ελληνικά</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004o">Complete beginner → B1. One cohort a month.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004p e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004p-s " data-id="e0004p" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004p">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004q-s " data-id="e0004q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004r">The one rule</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004s" class="e-ykrhga-e0004s-s e-heading-base">No English after minute three</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004t-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004t">The first three minutes are for admin and nerves. After that the room switches and stays switched for eighty-seven minutes. You will point, mime, draw, use the wrong word on purpose and get there anyway — and the teacher will help you get there in the language, never around it.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004u">Homework is only conversation. No worksheets, no gap-fills, no streaks to protect.</p>
		
</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004v e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004v-s " data-id="e0004v" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004v">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004x-s " data-id="e0004x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004x">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004y">Before any money moves</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004z" class="e-ykrhga-e0004z-s e-heading-base">A placement call before you pay</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00050-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00050">Nobody buys before a twenty-minute placement call. Roughly one in six people we speak to are told to start a level higher than they expected.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00051-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00051">It is a conversation, not a test. Ten minutes in English about why you are doing this, ten minutes in the language you are learning — however little of it you have. We tell you the level, the next intake date and, sometimes, that you should not book yet.</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00052 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00052-s " data-id="e00052" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00052">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00053-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00053"><a href="#placement" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Book a placement call
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00054 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00054-s " data-id="e00054" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00054">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00055 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00055-s " data-id="e00055" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00055">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00056-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00056">Minute 0–10</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">In English: three years of an app, and what still happens when a waiter answers you.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00059-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00059">Minute 10–20</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005a">In the language. Badly is fine. Silence is fine. We are listening for what you reach for.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005b-s " data-id="e0005b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005b">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005c">Same day</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005d">An email with your level, your intake date and the two evening slots you would keep for eight weeks.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005f e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005f-s " data-id="e0005f" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005g-s " data-id="e0005g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005g">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005h-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005h">Plainly</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005i" class="e-ykrhga-e0005i-s e-heading-base">Price, schedule and what happens if you miss a week</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005k-s " data-id="e0005k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005k">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005l">Price</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005m">£420 for the eight weeks, sixteen sessions. Paid after your placement call, in one payment or two.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o">Schedule</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p">Twice a week, ninety minutes each, evenings at 18:30 or 19:30 UK time. You keep the same two slots for the whole course.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005q-s " data-id="e0005q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005q">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r">If you miss a week</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s">Miss up to two and you can sit them with another cohort at no cost. Miss four and we move you to the next intake for free.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005t-s " data-id="e0005t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005t">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005u-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005u">Class size</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005v">Four students. Never five. If a cohort fills, you go to the next intake rather than into a bigger room.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005w-s " data-id="e0005w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005x">What you need</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005y">A camera, headphones and ninety minutes where nobody will interrupt you. No textbook — we send the material each Sunday.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>
<section class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005z-s " data-id="e0005z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005z" id="placement">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00060 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00060-s " data-id="e00060" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00060">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00061 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00061-s " data-id="e00061" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00061">
    			<h2 data-interaction-id="e00062" class="e-ykrhga-e00062-s e-heading-base">Book a placement call</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00063-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00063">Twenty minutes, free, no card. You will speak the language for ten of them and we will tell you honestly where you are. The next cohort of four starts the first Monday of the month.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00065-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00065"><a href="mailto:hello@verbo.school?subject=Placement%20call" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Book a placement call
	</a></p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00066">hello@verbo.school · £420 · sixteen sessions</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</section>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00067 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00067-s " data-id="e00067" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00067">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00068 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00068-s " data-id="e00068" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00068">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00069-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00069">Verbo</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006a">Live immersion language courses · four students · eight weeks</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
